OL,3,GNEWSAShooting victim was targeted as   
OL,4,Ashe lay in bed, say police             
OL,6,FA woman who was critically injured in a
OL,7,Ftargeted attack was shot as she lay in 
OL,8,Fbed, according to police.              
OL,10,FThe 27-year-old is in a critical but   
OL,11,Fstable condition in hospital following 
OL,12,Fthe incident in the Lambhill area of   
OL,13,FGlasgow at about 23:45 on Monday.      
OL,15,FOfficers described the incident as an  
OL,16,F"abhorrent" and "despicable" and said  
OL,17,Fthey were doing all they could to track
OL,18,Fdown the person responsible.           
